{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"fix\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"risk\": \"“那一步”没有明确说是哪一步，可能被误接成其他决定；“没走”也没有明确说是没有离开。\",\n      \"text\": \"可那份亲近越鲜活，当初那些委屈也跟着翻上来：当初离开的那一步走得对不对，后不后悔？如果当初没离开，如今又会怎样？\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"risk\": \"“不必时时防备”省略了主语，可能被读成身边的人不必防备，而不是他自己不必防备。\",\n      \"text\": \"心里那阵难受慢慢缓下来，他又想起从前和人在一起时，自己不必时时防备的日子；这回他没急着拿受过的气压住这份想念。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"risk\": \"“那股决心”没有明确说明是什么决心，可能被误读为找回亲近或不再受气的决心，而不是当初离开的决心。\",\n      \"text\": \"他想找回从前那份亲近，又不甘心回去再受那些气，可他连当初决定离开时的那股决心也找不着了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"risk\": \"“选边”没有明确说是哪两边，可能被读成在回去与不回去之间做选择，而不是不必在两段不同的经历之间否定其中一段。\",\n      \"text\": \"他想，当初那些气不该忍，和那些人在一起也确实开心过，这回他不逼自己非要在这两件事里只认一件了。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "69b8d701-7dec-4e60-a8d8-d7cc409f63c5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T185739988392Z", "elapsed_seconds": 174.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T19:00:34.196964+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3f604a32755c80402b8afe59b8db0bd1e5d220e2916a5340201f62039914d7c3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initi